This CLD expands the framework that controls Ontario's agriculture funding choices. Technology-focused initiatives that enhance small farms' adoption of technology can be supported by more public money. Increased adoption boosts net farm income and farm revenue by increasing productivity and cost efficiency. A reinforcing feedback loop that improves farm performance over time is created when farms are able to reinvest in more technology as their income increases. Farm consolidation can also be influenced by financial decisions.